  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Inclusive Partnerships for Smallholders in Rain-fed Areas (SIPRA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our outcomes objectives are:
 1: From low productivity levels to sustainable increased production and income for (female, 
young) smallholder farmers and (female-headed/youth-led) agro-SMEs in rain-fed agriculture areas.
 2: Agri-businesses have taken a more inclusive approach through partnerships, supply 
contracts and value chain development with smallholders and agro-SMEs in rainfed areas.
 3: A more conducive environment for small holder farmers, Agro-SMEs and agribusinesses to 
benefit from economic partnerships.</narrative>
  </description>
